  "_help": [
    "WORKOUTS = your library. Each has: sport (swim/bike/run/strength/other), name, target (shown under the name),",
    "min (default minutes) and intensity: recovery, easy, moderate, hard, very_hard, strength or race.",
    "WEEKS = one entry per week, keyed by the MONDAY date (YYYY-MM-DD). Each day is a list of workouts:",
    "  \"bike_z2\"                         -> the workout with its default duration",
    "  {\"w\": \"run_long\", \"km\": 16}       -> with a distance (duration is estimated from your Garmin data)",
    "  {\"w\": \"bike_z2\", \"h\": 2}           or {\"w\": \"swim_long\", \"min\": 50}",
    "  {\"w\": \"bike_1x30\", \"note\": \"172 W\"} -> extra note shown on the card",
    "Optional per week: label, phase, comment, run_limit_km (max running km that week), long_run_limit_km.",
    "An empty list [] = rest day. Weeks you don't list get an automatic suggestion."
  ],
